### 0. Blocked user (USER-002 in user_block) -> rejected up front (global context)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-002",
  "transactionMode": "TRANSFER",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "100001",
  "currency": "BDT",
  "amount": 10
}

### 1. Over limit + debit-restricted + BDT -> BLOCKED
# USER-001/TRANSFER/DR limit = 100; account 100001 drRes = 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transactionMode": "TRANSFER",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "100001",
  "currency": "BDT",
  "amount": 500
}

### 2. Within limit -> ALLOWED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transactionMode": "TRANSFER",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "100001",
  "currency": "BDT",
  "amount": 50
}

### 3. Not BDT -> ALLOWED (rule needs BDT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transactionMode": "TRANSFER",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "100001",
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 500
}

### 4. Not debit-restricted product (200001, drRes = 0) -> ALLOWED
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transactionMode": "CREDIT",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "200001",
  "currency": "BDT",
  "amount": 999999
}

### 5. Missing context (unknown account) -> 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transactionMode": "TRANSFER",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "999999",
  "currency": "BDT",
  "amount": 500
}

### 6. Missing amount -> 400 validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transactionMode": "TRANSFER",
  "debitCredit": "DR",
  "sourceAccount": "100001",
  "currency": "BDT"
}

### 7. Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
